      <div class="top-right"><span class="offline-indicator"><span class="pulse"></span> LOCAL-FIRST</span><button class="top-action" id="themeBtn" type="button" aria-label="Toggle light and dark theme">☼ <span>THEME</span></button><button class="top-action" id="exportQuick" type="button">↧ <span>EXPORT</span></button></div>
